    <region left="0" top="15651" width="529" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Use design tie force = 157.4 kNim. Tie reinforcement will be provided by the steel mesh<br />embedded within the 75mm thick concrete topping.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
