    <region left="0" top="16497" width="534" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>According to the Code, 1if the internal ties are properly anchored into the peripheral ties,<br />no additional ties for column is needed. Hence D7 mesh is adequate as column tie.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="16533" width="535" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
