        <content>
          <p>This area of tie will not be in addition to the column reinfo rcement if it is<br />greater than 0.43%. If the columns are precast with floor to floor joint, the<br />connections must be designed for the tension force of 469.93 kN and tie continuity from<br />foundation to roof properly detailed.</p>
