    <region left="18" top="19710" width="602" height="68" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>A precast floor is subjected to a total notional horizontal load of 220 kN in each orthogonal direction.<br />The floor elements consist of 300 mm deep hollow core slabs with 75 mm thick concrete topping<br />reinforced with D6 mesh (ϕ6 @ 100 both ways). Determine the critical forces and design the<br />reinforcement for effective floor diaphragm action.</p>
